              "html": "<p>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> угол <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var> равен <img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"86889ade-4724-487b-b241-b45b40f5c3f5\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/86889ade-4724-487b-b241-b45b40f5c3f5\"/><span data-inline-latex=\"6^{\\circ}\"></span>, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"B\">B</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"31^{\\circ}\"></span>. <var data-math-identifier=\"AD\">AD</var>, <var data-math-identifier=\"BE\">BE</var> и <var data-math-identifier=\"CF\">CF</var>  — вы­со­ты, пе­ре­се­ка­ю­щи­е­ся в точке <var data-math-identifier=\"O\">O</var>. Най­ди­те угол <var data-math-identifier=\"AOF\">AOF</var>. Ответ дайте в гра­ду­сах.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
